get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/1
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  ## Account read

  Read a game account by numeric id or account name.

  - Method and path: `GET /api/v1/accounts/<id-or-name>`. This request uses account id `1`.
  - Auth: valid HMAC signature only; no `X-GM-Actor` and no RBAC permission.
  - Success: `200` with `{"id","username","security","online"}`.
  - Failure: `401` bad signature, `404 target_not_found` when the account does not exist,
    `405` wrong method, `409` replayed nonce, `429` rate limited, `503 world_unavailable`.

  Change `1` in the URL to another id, or to an account name such as `ADMIN`.
}
